{
  "email": "otro@oikos.com",
  "password": "otracontraseña123"
}

### 2. Login con el segundo usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otro@oikos.com",
  "password": "otracontraseña123"
}

### 3. Listar categorías del segundo usuario (¡debe salir VACÍO!)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}




### Crear una cuenta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Cuenta corriente BBVA",
  "type": "BANK"
}

### Crear otra cuenta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Efectivo",
  "type": "CASH"
}

### Listar mis cuentas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}






### Listar cuentas (copia un id de cuenta)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar categorías (copia un id de categoría)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Crear un INGRESO de 2000 (Nómina)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountId": "a78730cf-e930-4119-ad34-44ba044843c5",
  "categoryId": "a5eed97a-5157-4188-8805-03146e3245fc",
  "amount": 2000.00,
  "type": "INCOME",
  "date": "2026-07-01",
  "note": "Nómina de julio"
}

### Crear un GASTO de 150 (Alimentación)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountId": "a78730cf-e930-4119-ad34-44ba044843c5",
  "categoryId": "130408bc-fa55-432f-9d8e-d287f80e5495",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "date": "2026-07-05",
  "note": "Compra semanal"
}

### Ver la cuenta — el balance debe ser 2000 - 150 = 1850
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/a78730cf-e930-4119-ad34-44ba044843c5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Crear presupuesto de 200 para Alimentación en julio 2026
POST http://localhost:8080/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "categoryId": "130408bc-fa55-432f-9d8e-d287f80e5495",
  "limitAmount": 200.00,
  "month": 7,
  "year": 2026
}

### Gasto que supera el presupuesto (otro gasto de 100 en Alimentación julio)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountId": "a78730cf-e930-4119-ad34-44ba044843c5",
  "categoryId": "130408bc-fa55-432f-9d8e-d287f80e5495",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "date": "2026-07-10",
  "note": "Gasto extra"
}

### Ver el presupuesto de nuevo — ahora debería estar superado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/budgets?month=7&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}